                                                "sense_id": "11b1f637-075d-37a1-b2a3-ba6fa2285de2",
                                                "text": "A surprising number of incidents is due to roof hatches being left loose or in the raised position when locomotives return to service after maintenance. On one occasion, a 25kV overhead line was damaged by an open hatch."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
